  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "文巧俗弊，將反大質。僵死如麻，流血漂杵。皆知其母，不識其父。干戈乃止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b7134f87d149c6482e4b0ee29a01f6645a1df9288d25978d11901810cdebb63f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:81297c276fa944bedf9182c58694fecebc4c259441f155a2e7698f162edf15e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "文王四乳，仁愛篤厚。子畜十男，無有夭折。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:afecad5d97346de4b2ac67c592bfd57e1872304decf1dccfe718329fb149174c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b509c3849664fad10871da02bce6af385cdbec82972942df2ce056733a11bd03"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "日入望車，不見子家。長女無夫，左手搔頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79985ae9bc00249cd543d1d09a0c019ffeb7e95f60a18746551ff6fa2d89f6ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c37a89a79c3d3f095dadfee6bfc98f0ef27936675ed854fad1ee583afd45a535"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "東上泰山，見堯自言。申理我冤，以解憂患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad870d5b8a1d2fc0a39208cea261dc7c542d5b522024931ceb096afd7b420280",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:20c4928ccbe52fe3f546cc37c2546fe560d3a0508d31a7e904560f2db758f6e2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "奎軫湯湯，過角宿房。宣時布和，無所不通。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e467898f07dc0784510962174b568c593bfa5229b0cd827fdda5c030ccc5129f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e3a18d6bdd859c298b5f5d712e8186d8f63dede131ec5d4d9a5aa982f38dad1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "引髯牽鬚，雖懼無憂。王母善禱，禍不成災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:097321d59b4afd3840bea139928a53095623c6ea1dfcf2e435c0519e06442b57",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c72d1ae57393955bbfdbc8256eca24a5167d83bafc58d1b0c95b40aaa6ed49d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "鳧得水沒，喜笑自啄。毛羽悅澤，利以攻玉。公出不復，柏氏容宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a0ac125fa2c231df624ad205313aab6967ff49dbae5c4c4d03fed1e3db152fd7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba20186576ccd27f49cb61f7295dd3dc633ab7c843fe86d7de544829e25e0fe1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "水流趨下，欲至東海。求我所有，買魴與鯉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f734a1872a47560a11d2a007b45e578e879678759ad34614da2727b91cced965",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a781ff585405229645ee9b61718cbade509dfb0d9e940b56d1efcc8a3a181ce4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "獐鹿逐牧，安飽其居。反還次舍，無乃疾故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:86aff50eb2d5536ad92cfe55e5b76327c71aced76b1d528f45b7c736441bca35",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50db9a3c3a2011ca777570bbea2de69665171f62f43adfab2f10c8554ac70f55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "樹植藿豆，不得耘耡。王事靡盬，秋無人收。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7d5e50f4079631baedb610f103daf56f85a4183a99992b763df0c0a0821d4963",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b90d444105ed09b01c78209994182cbd4c1fa4638e2d752eed3a7b84bc2f3a06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "弱水之西，有西王母。生不知老，與天相保。行者危殆，利居善喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a95ee2d8eed58fbc7ff4ca9357ab23f712425ceb52747b29916b566e6497f434",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ed7a51fa81cc983002132f9d969a355b940ddd8747b66e0e5b62f1844f473f3a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "數窮廓落，困於歷室。幸登玉堂，與堯侑食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6debf9170fd2bfcc9e4a4956be247e91e973da29b9c436632dd443fec75a2a9c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eb330387898c1ffff9009e83a1e713abd957c72c4e389bc42c122a752f2535f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "子鉏執麟，春秋作經。元聖將終，尼父悲心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c5d2968b8beee9352d677d3368702faa16c70945a6da42d488fbf7b75bdc372f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf65933fbe73ea50a7302a68428c6611a9120fae42f611a36d5a787aed75bffa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "尹氏伯奇，父子生離。無罪被辜，長舌所為。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f01ef21889273afb835c052a830362b5ca83dfd03261fb7e4ab3860213b9b5e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f78cd8cf9633f3a5c3f836f40e74fb7296fcd351cd7128db123aac439b0e10c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "播木折枝，與母別離。九皋難和，絕不相知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ad74b2eb9e6d0ba7346e4e473246d081885ff6ca43cf61c5a5d27cbd0e1c4d4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:820d8280667961b1133dfa8d364be2dccd0ee43942883ca8ef03963d2c6618ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "眵雞無距，與鵲格鬥。翅折目盲，為鳩所傷。復歸野廬，與母相扶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9fb4b50d2bd4d891f755a68c4a034fea0a46159bba02f4d35930b5ae3ebc6cc7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c020a7d9fcfb8ee4986a73edd3b637f6eece19e4e992e9c3e5115a3003f5dd8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "甲乙丙丁，俱歸我庭。三丑六子，入門見母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a56e2fe9036edd69d47411d0297a6b1bff9c76d8e96d5589c5066e0a656ee698",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4062859e12daf3a14ee667aa0ca447bca53a3736d1f75fc8bf649c0742dfeeaa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "桑葉螟蠹，衣敝如絡。女工不成，絲布為玉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:04d3e3bd8cf7c583d652ff670527b3c8a0401058c06bdebcf2443182c7f5936c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2303d8526c33e425fb1282b6d98a0b0d28a5d1109204fe57c531fda6d62c8f2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "開牢闢門，巡狩釋冤。夏臺羑里，商文悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2f4497023c41e41c2b11d54a351abd966dd5884d887201cea2ecdc241ea18e64",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:23330ddc2d73a25af315a3f9f8c413fc25cbd781a9925d309581f1125df8e8b2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "欽明之德，坐前玉食。必保嘉善，長受安福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f38f0e9e608f7ac4d62fe3aa1cfd6eac48c4bb16694be4494eceff2c78642f0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:33e5f57b2cb294c793f5a58fba91405f72d8b62cddcba6cd68b7bc8982e551a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "武夫司空，多口爭訟。金火當戶，民不安處。年饑無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ba096cbfe32812dee6a852c483c820e6074e44bf3d7ec7874f1e1a651e8f095",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c9626e3eaa77c87065c49089171f1b807b6c0639e9becb039bddb1a14d6428f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "紫闕九重，尊嚴在中。黃帝堯舜，履行至公。冠帶垂衣，天下康寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0c876cb5c138595cfbef8314237f93fe87c4739562042e034431065ec983ebdb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa8e11f47435c039d5e2c1c23662670a637c26e201730e10d1f5827850bed581"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "負牛上山，力少行難。烈風雨雪，遮遏我前。中道復還，憂者日歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:49867a4b36db7ae33f185c8076df62c5527386ce83814a01f3796b0a7680d0de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:76caae34d680e08db9c175eae34aa87843fba0e0883ac2bdbadec4128e94619e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "蹇兔缺唇，行難齒寒。口痛不言，為身生患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e65c92eaac38595af8a939122a90dfeca5968746a78edd50f5f884a87a39c7c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9dbbf0120c83a20bb40d04aefec71048d13157bcd6cb22adfc5e6f9eb16f5029"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "合體比翼，喜耦相得。與君同好，使我有福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a208dba03cfc5accd5b3448c631f07e8e8de71f10380845e8c19c74018a93bd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ec9ff76885a0177dc52e02762efdd0edc3ae3c471c252185fed264a98ca7ddb0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "憒憒不脫，憂從中出。喪我寶貝，亡妾失位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b8a183a08ecb94537ae0fa703c6d41997ffc20e73fbd560d95eeccf5dba2ef0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dbd31b6323bcb09946250088be6252c331cce5a238eded5265b8f819b6234aa4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "兩心不同，或從西東。明論終日，莫適我從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:838f83ccfc54bb415639ebb3780ab3015396296059a54182be7e202d2abab3ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a97a58a0621409ed75b157160fe540276d6e53f262281151455cdeb53994adb4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "啞啞笑言，與喜飲食。長樂行觴，千秋起舞。拜受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a5fbf7d3dbc46d9f184f0b1412f89ea9c956647dae6120a57536ea2c4beb5bd7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eb27b2cf2baddf4b477e9c9c0548ca8f34aeb5b5df2d1dabe7cf09da67495924"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "初憂後喜，與福為市。八佾列陳，飲御諸友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e99702fb9a6f01184a2fc5d18cfa34750f9e34ca089182ebd38178362fa21340",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e4b285056608c06ea6691bee72ee2c9549a59a85f8bd8a2d3495b9438740b0c8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "西徙無家，破其新事。王孫失利，不如止居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:292cc2d918179b4fa3ec247e7d41dee3b35e08f309c50332e9496c96b40005b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a2fd2d7cd9dfd9d88b4a1a7f8f791b4cdd32506de449f0dcd2757d7d9fcb310"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "鳳凰在左，麒麟處右。仁聖相遇，伊呂集聚。時無殃咎，福為我母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:783fcb8f7f05728a5480554ae69c3791219391eb2f656e6fc77a38444b53817f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a40ac0d94d8c252e9bbcf679eb8bd6b630212f6331d03b7960ebc3b21737c99"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "區脫康居，慕仁入朝。湛露之歡，三爵畢恩。復歸舊廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:826de8f100a9529f79ec75a04709a54617a659a0ed6a06670cf06179d58eb137",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6f56fe40da48a1ee0d05099cabb93869d9991991bb9f1cdc8c82dc76d2d9754e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "疾貧望幸，使伯行販。賈販市井，開牢擇羊。喜得大牂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5e3c26d878fe7f47235cb7ef023b0d17fe5e364c9646d7bf88e268722af1695",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c92f32b2cf944dec46cde20474cd3abad553764d7958af47ecece9b04fc88d14"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "處高不傷，雖危不亡。握珠懷玉，還歸其鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:285930e0bf4d88dd447dcb671335744299218e0514ad2810d655a7327e70c35b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a171fda1997c939357daa21fba72148a1d43413104051201e1df8c860e911d7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "右手棄酒，左手收柈。行逢禮御，餌德玉杯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3b524d726e3820dd6dad37eb9d86d414e9119a9b610357354dd2b9ce6b1107a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a9c3773adbf1a77353e5bcaa558b8ae21da4b49f4db1b78ad261c1c6262c5005"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "養虎牧狼，還自賊傷。大勇小捷，雖危不亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3b84fb28ce8fb10720c92ad1264cd7a9699f1760a71c1c8421245bec5c295e67",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5e57c86f51e9924972d07c9c328b5d24d24f9f784404dee08f356f7d30c37ce"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "戴堯扶禹，從喬彭祖。西遇王母，道路夷易。無敢難者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e9079e7f75446c6e05f7f4b45cc31a1d13abbc8a5f2027b16d5ce8ad7025dc2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca3112909b0467fa84d2e0fbdcb23e109958e17068255c7352e809632a3f427d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "秋冬探巢，不得鵲雛。御指北去，慚我少姬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dba611dd2782af6dad85d3e4013e50787cf01a5af7e571e0c14e2d921c63bbfd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:05f5b52c12420834916f1de6024d0f4d3cb53c2ac5c4ccb08b8c08d571fd69e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "兩羝三羊，俱之我鄉。留連多難，損其食糧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d0de6fa8950ea911bf2b0af7732d204c88165e914e015be8df891161c48d30f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3636878d4e761321af75efc89a0975ed64c34347594425537bf9cefd147f875b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "南徙無廬，鳥破其巢。伐木思切，不利動搖。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4bb752b1b65defda41fc3802aa240d64d04741b612d3b1d6d28e0f2c156f5fb6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09eab31a2b4fdfb83a19854c9c02af80ecf78dcb189941f58be55a8578205e12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "爭訟不已，更相牽擊。張季弱口，被髮北走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ae5e7e90d1630bdc807afb4f6708e120625d1b90b4b81ce3f82eaac9e7bc83c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fbc79e629c51b045d4a91de6ebf4ebb853a45de350a36c1a7737c2fddb6002a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "延頸望酒，不入我口。初喜後否，利得無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a2135427e9e8a0a01702068c3891be11537a22b9f1b794ea66109dd830460f4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1e74f5b78954f9093ff07ab479993e58e18cacf88759375949aaec37bf4eba1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "被髮傾走，寇逐我後。亡失刀兵，身全不傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de1187f1c2ab13ab52bdc5a1fb1eccdadd882970daabd18b3e3f434c0063bde9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67c00a777a0f514448286d80df572dacf67545fc4c4f9de76900f6d875222a8b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "麟鳳所遊，安樂無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5a411f286242afb50581bd4b105c037480b68f43cc95b287acbc52cf905bdd4b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:513d5d5ecbd295591b93e857eeca2cb4d17f3f5e1b1aa09cd085031da913b366"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "褰衣涉河，水深請罷。賴幸舟子，濟脫無他。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e52a7b673052e5ea8106382d3690ebb6ebd1a30150ce138dc1f713f0f4d91573",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1510923ad77a9a6949beb1f030d5948a9e46d30138154648b41f2cb0c60b4b3a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "憒憒不脫，憂從中出。喪我金罌，無妄失位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0fb111ee7df456bada7af2d95a86df877a1a9dc0cde62052a7cab96dd5f2ab7b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:259c3a6bdc495b80129b21c6b78a66736070209a7ab2a8700af3d34981f0eae6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "解跳不遠，心與言反。尼父妄行，菡 未華。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e252e8fea161040cbce3c9c83ad44a7e6272c9b1a8c6d4904c4011027bb31ffc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a9b675205f6b0768e8faf5027d798b57398f3da3cec15457ff4e234d5b338a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "大壯肥牸，惠我諸舅。內外和睦，不憂飢渴。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a3457c5e8adca92f6b81888a420ab1e7f96f1393fb8b4da39bcd47399bd89ac6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd279bf1919da8b501ceb553243344d8b3f3549896a51dd8ab1076323e611133"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "黃帝建元，文德在身。祿若陽春，封為魯君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a729ca774d5a72cbdad5bc556ac9fb80b39c7e1a38c49aaa2320ab68712b3c4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa8285604a951dc54ff3e612b648f5fd128e9dd53428647c2a78e857bcc4ef34"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "虎聚磨牙，以待豚豬。往必傷亡，宜待止居。一作虎厲其牙，以待犬豬。往必傷殘，摧敗無餘。利以止居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9d19138d14e192a63264b23889ff9df271918e9abd557a032ff4283befc7ddd9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aee144ddf4ef01311fbd0cffc60752324d22a589884a033627338d835ed89494"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "天地配享，立位光明。陰陽順序，以成厥功。天下和平。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:61044d5271e2def757cb85c2f8ef51630821f6152e31bfa02afb4310d03bb274",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d7798387e29e7feadb54ef05d21cd6c7a5dcb051258a1087d5599f41c58ceae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "猿墜高木，不踒手足。保我金玉，還歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33d579252606af63bc83d3b880d9c79887961e2381f93a546a9126267cde8d2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e459ff9aaf87eb1ba2f05ff16875c2020b4b0c787482738c91f0bffcab482cc4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "營室紫宮，堅不可攻。明神達德，君受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:562b81101a621e432dc38238475d80070864375d6643f6dc69bdcedf20510e14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3eb0184f8842f6ef91a413b0defddc6351e7955ab674e38cb8af431ae32050b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "孤翁寡婦，獨宿悲苦。目張耳鳴，無與笑語。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c02e544e13e69eb6c766b64dcc5b6794e23fee856b0a1c9bb88c233f54a2802",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:debf296520eeb0a4c9a1141ac4ba9f3d50a67050cfd0594940e5b17581534580"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "低頭竊視，有所畏避。行者不至，酒酸魚敗。眾莫貪嗜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e941d9e24313c09cbd33fa843b426fa77ee3ad3e9b610eee38f64642d512e4e9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3394d0e55ef62c9bba852b099d6c5cb2ff6fa84bdde41a6988d7469123f3ef0c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "載金販狗，利棄我走。藏匿淵底，悔折為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:919f0d8c914444bf3c8399ac5234ec1c936388d89673d826359b9b011e530375",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91f242d79ee5d304af20cfca24fba30213e8f8655c578d3ecdddbc96aebe0f6d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "行觸大諱，與司命忤。執囚束繫，鉗制於吏。憂人有喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d15226e6a8382b9f5ac2f3300a1077f902e743597deccdfbd14f156d2507b86d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0776c0fc85e9f18251f5a9b51eaf9298e556855b102f6839138ab6fa780a2085"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "執玉歡喜，佩之解攣。危詳及安，使我無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da2a40f665e0f5f4564d2ff570ff31273220d618ba7f5fb001188cbdc337cabd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5be783851f1b8bdeb9f819fb31974186dc81d901c8de893e4dfc3ee9391bb69d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "機杼騰擾，女功不成。長女許嫁，衣無襦褲。聞禍不成，凶惡消去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6602c336e24ce96b6f32e1cda4838c2c31872d48dc0f4232ecd28a4d6ba2c367",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:922db9cca3fd69ade163bac53a4da149b7a3e8b2578eb7dea4f6850a86ae96c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "金人鐵鉅，火燒左右。雖懼不恐，獨得全處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:769acaeba6fe2c596fba750b4d14ef51c66d91efd0ded63996a9dbcf34ecbd7b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b70fdccba90a71d6843657ad124f64cbe03929e4c33b91b96a7d0b8747928f11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "謝恩拜德，東歸吳國。舞蹈歡躍，恣樂受福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0e20f5dfe537ee5d8ce69530aff3bde93039fca97bbf1ac03d46f8810a755284",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8a631dab2dfd719306a14252914f9f25b8f5cb87375ab4915004e60206a12ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "青牛自咽，呼我俱田。歷山之下，可以多耕。歲樂時節，民人安業。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aeb06cabd8c444152bf09550bdacb9d4993201b10d07c622fd769183c7b6de48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22dc5ffd44bf01fe28b0fe0b30c63298ea04fb4d48acbfa8d2368f83893b6abf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "白雉群雊，慕德貢朝。湛露之恩，使我得懽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf8a9f10d699424f148ec12f7743c8bd51274c60a578aab8e2134c817f5cfa70",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78ecaac6a14993b997b6b741dff80dd88033787c8fb60c0a72c0309ce6a67c07"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 6,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "避患東西，反入禍門。糟糠不足，憂思我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2132b9deaec73de25ed48bb2015cbef91842ca7de6a3306d270240e4289839b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:487751d3270dd9c18e6110330dcef08ca779b5d0d460625c736dc1f37ff45828"
    }
  ]
}
